ack."}, {"start": "05:51:08", "end": "05:51:38", "text": "Let me say this, I will make it, eat a bitch up, bless me like a brain mantis. Outside alone, Anastasia, but my boy's box got it linked up like a trachea. Every little room, I switch a tune, I'm the full moon, I will choose who I want to heal too. You know what, bitch, if you did me wrong, you are fucking done, you are fucking done, you are bygone. Everything is dull, yes, I work well, did it to a tall, cause I could switch like a set tall. Every little team, every industry, they ain't to me, even overseas, they were just a great. Jamaica is a beast, like a new breed, time to unleash with a fab teeth, make a run of feats, this is the EP."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Spiritual Ideation", "artists": [{"name": "Gary Bartz"}, {"name": "Adrian Younge & Ali Shaheed Muhammad"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:19:20"}, "track": {"title": "100°", "artists": [{"name": "DERBY"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:34:05"}, "track": {"title": "DEAD", "artists": [{"name": "Sudan Archives"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:53:46"}, "track": {"title": "choke enough", "artists": [{"name": "Oklou"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:01:04"}, "track": {"title": "happiness (live)", "artists": [{"name": "Adrianne Lenker"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:04:33"}, "track": {"title": "Real Life", "artists": [{"name": "Acopia"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:19:07"}, "track": {"title": "VALLE DASMASH 2026 – SUPER VALLE RITMIKE", "artists": [{"name": "Alb Studio"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence"